  "task_contract": {
    "degradation": "bicubic downsample x2",
    "input": "input.npy 128x128 normalized",
    "metric": "mean SSIM; PSNR/LPIPS diagnostics; baseline_bands missing; evaluator blocked_metric_assets",
    "modality": "chest_xray",
    "output": "agents_outputs/{case_id}/enhanced.npy 256x256 float finite",
    "reference": "private /data/private/{case_id}/reference.npy; no cases in package",
    "task_id": "nih-cxr-sr-task",
    "tiers": "Lite Swin2SR x2",
    "operator": "Declared2\u00d7 bicubic downsample128\u00b2\u2192256\u00b2 target; no degradation implementation, bicubic coefficients/library/antialias/alignment, axis/FOV/physical pixel spacing, original image selection or normalization pipeline supplied. SVG authored2\u00b2\u21924\u00b2 geometry-only cells, high-resolution values unknown; no resized chest X-ray/result.",
    "assistance": "Full Lite Swin2SR x2 caidas/swin2SR-classical-sr-x2-64, grayscale/model/grayscale conversion unspecified. Full Standard at least3 methods, at least2 public pretrained neural; training/finetuning/private access forbidden. Related Lite/gallery not equivalent.",
    "format": "Task-specific256\u00d7256 conflicts generic preamble same shape as input. Format checker shape from private reference,2D floating finite; acceptsfloat64, no[0,1]/nonconstant check despite promptfloat32normalized requirement. Output root agents_outputs plural versus some task prompt agent_outputs singular; task.json/all.md establishplural.",
    "metrics": "Config mean_ssim, diagnosticsPSNR/LPIPS; runner computesall3 and aligned+cyclicshuffle. SSIM skimage Gaussian true/population covariance, data_range privateCSV or refmax\u2212min; PSNRfloat32MSE<=1e\u221212\u219299; LPIPS Alex per-image independentminmax[-1,1], grayscale3channels, constant\u21920; checkpoint/package absent. No metrics computed.",
    "effective": "Declared NIH evaluator_task_id and website_task_id nih-cxr-sr-task; runner consumes TASK environment (default empty), binding not executed. NIH literal absent v2 TASK_NORM/RATING_THRESHOLDS; code genericv1 namedclinical=(clip((PSNR\u221220)/30)+clip(SSIM)+clip(1\u2212LPIPS))/3, independent of v3 bands. assign_rating hardfails invalid/aborted/noPSNR/completion<.5; if bands exist v3 A/B/C gates rawPSNR+SSIM only, LPIPS notgated. No bands supplied => v2 unknown_task C for otherwise valid NIH, not MRI-SR/LDCT thresholds. Passrate wrapper independently loads /eval/<TASK>/baseline_bands.json classicalSSIM\u2212.02; path differs scorer _load_bands auto-task suffix. NIH already ends-task => same task folder whenenvironmentcorrect. Missing assets/runtime and bands; namedclinical is code composite, no clinical validation.",
    "denominators": "Declaredcase count unknown. score_all averages nonNaN per metric, n_valid checksPSNR only; format n_valid countsfinitefloating shape. Missingoutput contributesNaNs and totalcase denominator retained; runner scoresallIDs ifanyvalid, notfilteredinvalid =>badshape/nonfinite mayraise/propagate. Pass rate ifbands known usesallper-patient rows denominator. Onecase cyclicshuffle unchanged identity, not independentnegativecontrol.",
    "reference_policy": "Late reader-only evaluator/format rules, never private target/answer reveal"
  },
